## Do NOT

- **Widen a gate config to go green.** The files are listed in
  `docs/AGENT-GUARDRAILS.md`. If one of them is the thing standing between you
  and a green build, the gate is working.
- **Delete or disable a test to make a build pass.** `.claude/hooks/` refuses
  this before the edit lands, and states the route to approval when it does.
